msgid "Region"
msgstr "区域"

msgid ""
"The ``REGION`` program allows a correlated method to be applied to a target "
"region within a molecule, where it is restricted to a subset of spatially "
"localised orbitals, and the rest of the valence electrons left uncorrelated "
"and only treated at the mean-field level."
msgstr ""
"``REGION`` "
"程序允许将相关方法应用于分子内的目标区域，该方法被限制在一组空间局域化的轨道子集内，而其余的价电子则保持非相关状态，仅在平均场水平进行处理。"

msgid ""
"The correlated region can be embedded within an SCF environment (that of the"
" reference wave function), or within a lower level correlated method using a"
" simple subtractive approach (see section `Multi-layer embedding "
"<region.html#multi-layer-embedding>`__). Multi-layer embedding can also be "
"achieved using the same subtractive approach."
msgstr ""
"相关区域可以嵌入到 SCF 环境（参考波函数的环境）中，或者使用简单的减法方法嵌入到较低级别的相关方法中（参见 `Multi-layer "
"embedding <region.html#multi-layer-embedding>`__ 节）。多层嵌入也可以通过相同的减法方法实现。"

msgid "Defining the Orbital Spaces"
msgstr "定义轨道空间"

msgid "The molecular orbitals are controlled using the directives:"
msgstr "分子轨道通过以下指令控制："

msgid ""
"Molecular orbitals are read from the dump record given after ``START``, and "
"saved to the dump record given after ``SAVE``"
msgstr "分子轨道从 ``START`` 后指定的转储记录中读取，并保存到 ``SAVE`` 后指定的转储记录中。"

msgid ""
"The initial occupancies of each orbital space are controlled using the usual"
" directives:"
msgstr "每个轨道空间的初始占据数使用常规指令控制："

msgid ""
"The correct number of core orbitals must be known to the ``REGION`` program "
"(either through inheriting it from the previous calculation, or through "
"explicit declaration by the user). The core orbitals are kept separate from "
"the inactive orbital space when performing the IBO localisation. If the "
"definition of the core is changed, these two spaces will mix, leading to a "
"slightly different set of embedded IBOs."
msgstr ""
"``REGION`` 程序必须知道正确的芯轨道数量（无论是从前一次计算继承而来，还是由用户明确定义）。在执行 IBO "
"局域化时，芯轨道与非活性轨道空间保持分离。如果芯的定义发生改变，这两个空间将会混合，导致产生一组略有不同的嵌入 IBO。"

msgid "Selecting the Embedded Orbitals"
msgstr "选择嵌入轨道"

msgid ""
"The IBOs to be embedded can be specified directly with the ``ORBITALS`` "
"option, either using their index, or as a range of indices e.g.,"
msgstr "要嵌入的IBO轨道可以直接通过\\ ``ORBITALS``\\ 选项指定，可以使用其索引，或使用索引范围，例如："

msgid ""
"Alternatively, the orbitals can be found automatically by choosing a set of "
"target atoms with the ``ATOMS`` option. Orbitals exerting an IBO partial "
"charge of at least ``THRESH_REGION`` (default=0.2 a.u.) on *any* of the "
"target atoms, are included in the embedding region. Atoms may be specified "
"using their names in the geometry specification, index, or using ranges of "
"indices e.g."
msgstr ""
"或者，可以通过使用\\ ``ATOMS``\\ 选项选择一组目标原子来自动找到轨道。对\\ *任何*\\ 目标原子施加至少\\ "
"``THRESH_REGION``\\ （默认=0.2 "
"a.u.）IBO部分电荷的轨道，将被包含在嵌入区域中。原子可以使用其在几何结构规范中的名称、索引或索引范围来指定，例如："

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid ""
"Further control of the ``ATOMS`` option is achieved using the ``ORB_SELECT``"
" option, which controls how strictly the target atoms inherit their "
"orbitals. When ``ORB_SELECT=INCLUSIVE`` (the default), an orbital is "
"embedded if *any* of the atoms it sits on are included in the target atoms. "
"When ``ORB_SELECT=EXCLUSIVE``, an orbital is only embedded if *all* the "
"atoms it sits on are included in the target atoms. For example, in the "
"following molecule:"
msgstr ""
"通过\\ ``ORB_SELECT``\\ 选项可以进一步控制\\ ``ATOMS``\\ 选项，该选项控制目标原子继承其轨道的严格程度。当\\ "
"``ORB_SELECT=INCLUSIVE``\\ （默认）时，如果轨道所在的\\ *任何*\\ 原子包含在目标原子中，则该轨道被嵌入。当\\ "
"``ORB_SELECT=EXCLUSIVE``\\ 时，仅当轨道所在的\\ *所有*\\ "
"原子都包含在目标原子中时，该轨道才被嵌入。例如，在以下分子中："

msgid "The command"
msgstr "命令"

msgid "selects only the carbon-carbon sigma and pi bonds, whereas the command"
msgstr "仅选择碳-碳σ键和π键，而命令"

msgid "selects all the bonds."
msgstr "选择所有键。"

msgid ""
"Core orbitals (as defined by the ``CORE`` variable) are exuded from the "
"embedding region."
msgstr "芯轨道（由\\ ``CORE``\\ 变量定义）被排除在嵌入区域之外。"

msgid ""
"Finally the embedded orbital space is made pseudo-canonical by diagonalising"
" the embedded-embedded block of the Fock matrix, and similarly the "
"active/open orbitals. This can be disabled by setting the "
"``SEMI_CAN=false``."
msgstr ""
"最后，通过对角化 Fock 矩阵的嵌入-嵌入块，使嵌入轨道空间成为伪正则的，对活性/开轨道也进行类似处理。这可以通过设置 "
"``SEMI_CAN=false`` 来禁用。"

msgid "Truncating the virtual space"
msgstr "截断虚空间"

msgid ""
"The ``FCI`` program, and some third-party programs interfaced to Molpro, can"
" handle a reduction in the number of virtual orbitals. This procedure is "
"called the *deleted virtual approximation*, and can significantly reduce the"
" cost of correlated calculations. When the option ``FULL_VIRT=false``, a "
"truncated virtual space localized to the embedding region is constructed "
"from projected atomic orbitals (PAOs). By default ``FULL_VIRT=true`` and the"
" full canonical virtual space from the previous SCF calculation is retained."
msgstr ""
"``FCI`` 程序以及一些与 Molpro 接口的第三方程序可以处理虚轨道数量的减少。此过程称为\\ *删除虚轨道近似*\\ "
"，可以显著降低关联计算的成本。当选项 ``FULL_VIRT=false`` "
"时，会从投影原子轨道（PAOs）构建一个定位于嵌入区域的截断虚空间。默认情况下 ``FULL_VIRT=true``\\ ，保留先前 SCF "
"计算得到的完整正则虚空间。"

msgid ""
"PAOs located on a set of ‘host atoms’ are transformed by means of a singular"
" value decomposition of their overlap matrix. Virtual functions with an "
"eigenvalue below ``THRESH_REDUN`` (default=\\ :math:`1.0\\times10^{-8}`) are"
" considered redundant and deleted. PAOs on the other, environment, atoms are"
" also discarded."
msgstr ""
"位于一组‘宿主原子’上的 PAOs 通过对其重叠矩阵进行奇异值分解来变换。特征值低于 ``THRESH_REDUN``\\ （默认=\\ "
":math:`1.0\\times10^{-8}`\\ ）的虚函数被视为冗余并被删除。位于其他环境原子上的 PAOs 也会被丢弃。"

msgid ""
"Host atoms are those sat ‘underneath’ the embedded occupied orbitals. When "
"the embedded orbitals exert an IBO partial charge of at least "
"``THRESH_REGION`` (default 0.2 a.u.) on an atom, then it is classified as a "
"host atom. Further host atoms may be manually included by using the "
"``HOST_ATOMS`` option. This allows the virtual domain to be extended."
msgstr ""
"宿主原子是那些位于嵌入占据轨道‘下方’的原子。当嵌入轨道对某个原子施加的 IBO 部分电荷至少为 ``THRESH_REGION``\\ （默认 0.2"
" a.u.）时，该原子即被归类为宿主原子。可以通过使用 ``HOST_ATOMS`` 选项手动包含更多的宿主原子。这允许扩展虚域。"

msgid ""
"The truncated virtual space is made pseudo-canonical by diagonalising the "
"virtual-virtual block of the Fock matrix. This can be disabled by setting "
"the ``SEMI_CAN=false``."
msgstr "通过对角化 Fock 矩阵的虚-虚块，使截断虚空间成为伪正则的。这可以通过设置 ``SEMI_CAN=false`` 来禁用。"

msgid "Multi-layer embedding"
msgstr "多层嵌入"

msgid ""
"Treating the environment with a second correlated method (that is usually "
"less expensive) is done with a simple subtractive embedding procedure, "
"defined as"
msgstr "使用第二种相关方法（通常成本较低）处理环境，是通过一个简单的减法嵌入过程完成的，定义为"

msgid "E = E_{low}(A+B) - E^{reg}_{low}(A) + E^{reg}_{high}(A)."
msgstr ""
"E = E_{low}(A+B) - E^{reg}_{low}(A) + E^{reg}_{high}(A).\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"The argument :math:`A` denotes the central target region, and :math:`B` the "
"environment, and the subscripts denote the accuracy (and cost) of the "
"correlated methods. :math:`E^{reg}_{low}(A)` is an energy calculation "
"performed using the ``REGION`` program, with a lower level correlated method"
" on the target region, for example MP2. Similarly :math:`E^{reg}_{high}(A)` "
"is performed with a higher level correlated method on the *same* target "
"region, for example CISD."
msgstr ""
"参数 :math:`A` 表示中心目标区域，\\ :math:`B` 表示环境，下标表示相关方法的精度（和成本）。\\ "
":math:`E^{reg}_{low}(A)` 是使用 ``REGION`` 程序在目标区域上使用较低级别相关方法（例如 "
"MP2）进行的能量计算。类似地，\\ :math:`E^{reg}_{high}(A)` 是在\\ *同一个*\\ 目标区域上使用更高级别相关方法（例如"
" CISD）进行的计算。"

msgid ""
"Multiple embedding layers can be achieved through repeatedly applying the "
"above equation."
msgstr "通过重复应用上述方程可以实现多层嵌入。"

